      "scenario": "Producer opens final response path then serializes JSON; consumer waits only for existence and immediately JSON.parse()s it. A scheduler interleaving exposes empty/partial JSON.",
      "actual": "Both unmodified full runs exited 1 (first A-filesystem, retry B-command), each with SyntaxError before its observer receipt was recorded. Completed response files are valid JSON. Verbatim consumer counterexample deterministically throws SyntaxError while writer is mid-response.",
