        "sha256": "ef73baec0794b8724e61fcecc717d4c14516d3594c447a0a4fe88cb810599485"
      },
      "suggestedRepair": "Atomically publish a complete response using a same-directory temporary file and rename, or an explicit completed-response protocol with a bounded read. Preserve real malformed-response errors and current failure history; add a publication-race regression, then rerun the full default suite."
    },
